  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1607.02 Incomplete Waiver Requests. Any waiver request that is received by the department that does not conform with Jus 1607.01(c) shall be deemed incomplete and returned to the requestor with an explanation.\n\nSource. #10177, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13551, eff 2-2-23",
